---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import LegalFrame from '~/components/LegalFrame.astro';
const headings=[{slug:'scope',text:'1. Scope'},{slug:'storage',text:'2. Local preferences and game score'},{slug:'hosting',text:'3. Hosting and external links'},{slug:'contact',text:'4. Contact and your choices'}];
---
<Base locale="en" path="/privacy" title="Website Privacy" description="How the SATER website handles local preferences, the browser game and contact messages.">
<LegalFrame title="Website Privacy" current="privacy" updated="14 October 2026" headings={headings}>
<h2 id="scope">1. Scope</h2><p>This notice covers thesater.com, published by SATER. Each app and game has its own Privacy Policy and Terms, linked from its product page. Those documents describe the product itself.</p>
<h2 id="storage">2. Local preferences and game score</h2><p>The website uses your browser’s local storage to remember the light/dark theme and the best score in the SATER runner game. These values are stored on your device, without a website account or a SATER cloud leaderboard. Clearing this website’s browser storage removes them. The website does not include a separate advertising or analytics SDK.</p>
<h2 id="hosting">3. Hosting and external links</h2><p>GitHub Pages hosts this website. Loading pages sends normal request information, including your IP address, to the hosting infrastructure. The provider handles that information under its own policies. See the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.</p><p>Links to Google Play, YouTube, Facebook and other services take you to their websites, where their policies apply. We do not receive your login credentials for those services.</p>
<h2 id="contact">4. Contact and your choices</h2><p>If you email <a href="mailto:sater.studios@gmail.com">sater.studios@gmail.com</a>, we receive your address and the information you include and use it to answer your request. Avoid including sensitive information that is unnecessary for your enquiry. Contact us about information you have sent directly to SATER or with a privacy request. We update this notice when the website’s handling changes and revise the date above.</p>
</LegalFrame></Base>
